{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b62cd9b5e6f7db85a6a8fa92c9ae60611b1b4f7ff5d979f98bcd6d96d0a3276f", "ja": "（紗代子に、初めてイベントの出演オファーがきた。\n今日は、会場の下見に来ている……）", "zh": "（纱代子接到了第一份活动的工作邀约。\n今天我们到会场进行场勘……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "bd928af104d122e93512005a67b2dc6d41f2e84a93d3591f5be196eee128b188", "ja": "劇場のステージと、全然雰囲気が違う……。\nここが、今度の会場なんですね！", "zh": "气氛和剧场的舞台完全不同……\n这里就是下次工作的会场啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "08d32be3d9aa0e344c3c41a151291bba7a84382f6ae534bfe049ef6695456c99", "ja": "このライブを成功させたら、もっとたくさんの\nオファーが来るかもしれません。頑張らないと！", "zh": "如果这场演唱会顺利成功，或许就会接到更多工作邀约。\n我一定要好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3073a845a3ba400759a1a408a307dd3ebf95248e81a181f1da9ab3848a8e81e8", "ja": "はは、気合い充分だな。でも今日は下見だけだし、\nわざわざ一緒に来なくても良かったのに。", "zh": "哈哈，真有干劲呢。\n不过今天只是来场勘而已，你其实不必特地跟过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "2bbb68d1b25a2ee453ba0fece2e901399b8fb26723304b2c68eb3402797e013d", "ja": "いえ！　実際にこの目で見て、\nステージの感覚をつかんでおきたかったんです！", "zh": "别这么说！我想实际来现场看看，\n熟悉一下在舞台上的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5c65bed1cb3108bc1dca1b17a7aa00c4e7c977941be76184d9105f9a4216544b", "ja": "そうか。でもステージの感覚を知りたいなら、\n劇場でも良かったんじゃないのか？", "zh": "这样啊。\n不过要熟悉舞台的话，在剧场也可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "d4d2bbd7f180eaefd93bb1336cb7f330447a53643ff92234c51288d6d8a0d44c", "ja": "いえ、それじゃダメなんです！\nあっ……私、ちょっと準備してきますね！", "zh": "不，在剧场是不行的！\n啊……我先去准备一下喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ccc9f1e6dbc5aacd86d3b1e11e54f01a19746f4009bd14a0ae3bd7775814d9e0", "ja": "準備？", "zh": "准备？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "0492148a4b1c00bfd4dd819ba0b65a1d408f6fcb169b55ba0bdee8c39a221eac", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしました！", "zh": "{$P$}，久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0a93184bc25824cff99222e4dd690faa3bce0fb688f6090a0f47a9d0762d7a48", "ja": "衣装？　わざわざ着替えてきたのか、紗代子。", "zh": "表演服装？纱代子，你还特地跑去换装啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "1edd305e5d98be1ba874af42caf798fddc50d918f76f82a4d295ae2c524198fb", "ja": "はい、できるかぎり本番と同じ状態でやりたくて……。\nさっそく、ステージの上を歩いてみますね！", "zh": "是的，我想尽可能模拟正式登台的状态……\n那我这就上舞台走走看啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "49753e89acfd30e7a9a406c5da987b745aa427eae6cae5902da1046444a2f6f7", "ja": "えーと、端から端までの距離は……。\n1歩、2歩、さん……わ、わわっ！？", "zh": "我看看，舞台两端相隔的距离是……\n一步、两步、三……哇、哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "358fd86d40588a83dee7f4a41e3dd8ee72c72ccf346bd72bdab5b415b72090c5", "ja": "紗代子、大丈夫か！？", "zh": "纱代子，你没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "d001eb924ca68dab2d3e3d479a191da838a158b98723f43e9477af793a04096b", "ja": "す、すみません！　コードにつまづいちゃって……。\nでも大丈夫です、ケガはしてませんから！", "zh": "对、对不起！我被电线绊了一下……\n不过没事的，我没有受伤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2dbc99cc8e47d5ce227645cf6900a42c07e60fd3a7dfe57c14f0ecf9e445d206", "ja": "……紗代子？\n俺はこっちだぞ。", "zh": "……纱代子？\n我在这里喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "8f4556d38e61f4e36b7eee9aad733548d90deed240eec254e70f5518b5b6c365", "ja": "え？　……あっ！？\nす、すみません、スタッフの人と間違えましたっ。", "zh": "咦……啊！？\n对、对不起，我把工作人员误认成你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8e4ccc82ab822742c710ae90a90c6a27315499c8ec5b6a9e4e2a8b034a70b635", "ja": "もしかして紗代子……\nメガネを外すと、よく見えないのか？", "zh": "纱代子，你该不会……\n没有眼镜就看不清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "957b390c210d2368ea4eb1f343f0af1ec83bae91c6713862a75d632097cae432", "ja": "はい、実は……。でも、そこまでじゃありませんよ？\nちょっと、ぼやけるっていうか……。", "zh": "嗯，没错……不过，我的近视没有很深喔？\n只是会稍微有点模糊而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "ea7a27dd4475a00b68abe36a2ba712c2cc13931baeb4a18fc0d67c49111f6477", "ja": "本当はコンタクトを使えばいいんでしょうけど、\n体質的に合わないみたいで……。", "zh": "其实只要戴隐形眼镜就好了，\n但我的体质似乎不太适合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3c7293b455485fc7b3cfc1be94e331392c728f8173644c8b6b9c625c56cc12b4", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n今までの公演は、どうしてたんだ？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n那你在之前的公演是怎么解决这个问题的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "43226d1aa7ed3c794685c2922d854b546d4848bb2c5206f03ba3f9b90b110286", "ja": "はい！　事前のレッスンで、照明やセットの位置を\nばっちり把握してから、ステージに上がってました！", "zh": "我会在演出前的训练课程中\n事先掌握灯光和布景的位置，再登上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2f302fceb252d1fd245d0f2a68d843d3715d053605db39a507f5af34152cab2e", "ja": "そうだったのか……。でもそんなに大変なら、\n律子みたいにメガネのまま出てもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此……但是，既然这么辛苦，\n怎么不像律子一样戴着眼镜登台就好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d1900333a5d53906c602523c8456384a6a94902bd2f7ea3b0a8a28448ad40a3e", "ja": "いっそ、メガネアイドルとして売り出してみるとか。", "zh": "干脆成为以眼镜为卖点的偶像也不失为一个办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "d35fa5b5e5f463958ca54196b89b67c37ffe6399e3729d3908fd475a0e456cd5", "ja": "いえ、それはダメなんです！\n私、あの子と別れた時、メガネをかけてなくて……。", "zh": "不，那可不行！\n因为我跟她分开的时候没有戴眼镜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1024_p", "source_sha256": "40347740bf66750cc964c455eecdad5428e5bceb3bf378dc37653e544c32bcbc", "ja": "あの子……アイドルになって、\n一緒のステージに立とうって約束した子のことか？", "zh": "你说的「她」，\n是指那位跟你约好要一起成为偶像，站上舞台的女孩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "b7d49a75a29f13a5ce0f794ee2078000274212ef2d6f211b3dc55fd18d11d54a", "ja": "はい。メガネをかけていたら、あの子に、私だって\n気づいてもらえないかもしれないです。だから……。", "zh": "嗯，要是戴上眼镜，\n她或许就不会发现是我了，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1026_p", "source_sha256": "818f04b676ab9263693217f869ee94f5f4c97acbb8f060b3c38b1537701a4fc5", "ja": "……わかった。なら、今度から外でライブする時は、\n会場の下見ができるようにスケジュールを調整するよ。", "zh": "……我知道了，那以后要在外面开演唱会时，\n我会帮你调整行程，让你可以进行场勘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "d2df4828742956ab590a244c7ce47f7694abea60ea73e4663b6dd4555ce4ad55", "ja": "えっ！？　{$P$}、いいんですか？\nこれは、私のワガママみたいなもので……。", "zh": "咦！？{$P$}，真的可以吗？\n这只是我的任性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1028_p", "source_sha256": "50618afb6c85210d196129f2b2d356c7d5518eb4143b6fd9e3c31a5ba866f035", "ja": "気にしなくていいよ。\nアイドルの望みを叶えるのが、俺の仕事だからな！", "zh": "不用介意。\n实现偶像的心愿就是我的工作啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "a759cacbfa5d955a51517368cc3677fabea888b16b0da0bcdfde32346d006ecb", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}……非常谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1030_p", "source_sha256": "78ada948297a1dbae3101792855dfbbf06640b8545af0750f64571ec14adc2c2", "ja": "それじゃあ、下見を続けよう。\nで、思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "那么，继续进行场勘吧。\n不过，我有个建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2276e5caaf2a2714cec5e4d0a484804d91ed9cd9ee5caa3491363f7790015e57", "ja": "メガネを外すのは、先にステージの感覚を\nつかんでからでもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "你应该可以先熟悉完舞台\n再摘下眼镜吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "18d5c451a3b832526b1cec8709c5bffe275317ee278690e2328d52c8b052e0bf", "ja": "えっ？　えっと、つまり……\nまずメガネをしたまま、ステージの感覚を……。", "zh": "咦？那个，你的意思是……\n先戴着眼镜熟悉舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "5184d46f9f3387a838f2d9a8177af6a600e1f6c46d3a2245c41315b0d05f28d8", "ja": "た、たしかに！\nそのほうが、確実にステージを覚えられますね。", "zh": "的、的确！\n这样可以更确实地记住舞台全貌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "9d55062de6705a5fceecbd637d5a5da228ed4ac8e1ec2d9d399c028d235924e8", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\n私、メガネ取ってきますね！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我现在就去把眼镜戴起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_005_1035_p", "source_sha256": "19cf27e48c5fea47138514cc204f892cbcdfa1cd99cc5d9fdc39e56fc602d90f", "ja": "（……一見、しっかりしてるように見えるんだけどな。\nこれからも、いろいろとフォローが必要そうだ！）", "zh": "（……虽然她看上去是个稳重的女孩，\n不过看来今后也得多多辅助她才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
